    "- Large enough (30 000 records) to train reliable models, light enough to run on a laptop\n",
    "- Includes a company response and dispute flag we can use to build sentiment labels\n",
    "- Covers billing, claims, customer service and communication — the same topics a medical aid client would see\n",
    "\n",
    "**Limitations:**\n",
    "- Labels are rule-based, not human-annotated — some noise expected\n",
    "- US financial data, not South African medical aid data — language patterns may differ slightly\n",
    "\n",
    "**Data quality indicators checked:** class balance, missing values, duplicates, label reliability (Provost and Fawcett, 2013)"
