    "## 11. Business Insights & Recommendations\n",
    "\n",
    "| Finding | Business Implication | Recommended Action |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| One or two topics dominate complaint volume | A single root cause drives most dissatisfaction | Prioritise a process/policy review for that specific area first |\n",
